- Run terminal commands ONE at a time. Never chain commands with && or ||.
- Never use redirection (>, >>, 2>&1) or pipes (|).
- Run cd as its own command before other commands.
- NEVER run git commit or git push. Report completed work; the human commits.
- NEVER modify files via shell commands (python -c, sed, awk, echo redirects). Always use the file editing tools (replace_in_file / write_to_file).

## Design System (mandatory)
- Canonical system: docs/unity-design-system.md. Application rules:
 docs/prototype-style-guide.md. Read both before any UI work.
- Import the T object from frontend/src/theme/tokens.ts; never hardcode hex/rgba
 values inline. If a needed value is missing, STOP and ask — check the
 canonical doc for the right primitive first and propose the mapping.
- Reuse primitives from frontend/src/components/ui/; never re-declare in page
 files. New primitives: propose first, then add to frontend/src/components/ui/
 AND document in docs/prototype-style-guide.md in the same change.
- Follow the page skeleton and interaction rules in the style guide.
- Type sizes only from the Unity scale (20/15/14/12) — no 13px.
- Spacing only from the Unity spacer scale.
- This prototype is a light-surface adaptation — do not convert to dark
 surfaces, and do not use the old Ionix palette (#17212f, #F2D641).
- Icons from lucide-react only. No pushes.

